codex
The source-level proof needs the fuel invariant, but the preflighted Base made that invariant’s helper functions private. I’m adding a proof-only adapter that aliases those exact compiled private constants—without changing or reimplementing them—so the induction can state and prove the actual operational invariant. This adapter contributes no logical assumptions and remains kernel-transparent.
apply patch
patch: completed
